      "source_hex": "82b182ea82c582a282a282f182be82e6814281779056978582cc8be08aa5817882aa0a82c782f182c882e082cc82a982cd95aa82a982c182bd82b5814194de82cc82d982a482aa0a82b182ea82f0954b977682c682b582c482a282e982f182be82e082cc",
      "current_hex": "546869732069732066696e652e20576520736177207468652063726f776e2c0a20616e64206865206e65656473206974206d6f72652e",
      "source_japanese": "これでいいんだよ。『新羅の金冠』が\nどんなものかは分かったし、彼のほうが\nこれを必要としているんだもの",
      "current_english": "This is fine. We saw the crown,\n and he needs it more.",
      "terminology_retention_reason": "The crown is the item just handed over. Rafael refers back to it while explaining why Julian needs it."
    },
    {
      "file_path": "/data/SC1.DK4",
      "block": 176,
      "source_body_offset": 833,
      "current_body_offset": 801,
      "selector": 26,
      "source_hex": "82da82ad82c9944382b982c482a882a282c481490a88ea8d8f82e0918182ad81779056978582cc8be08aa5817882f08ee882c993fc82ea82c40a8c4e82cc94f78fce82dd82f08ee682e896df82b582c482dd82b982e982e68149",
      "current_hex": "4c6561766520697420746f206d6521205468652063726f776e0a2077696c6c20626520796f7572732c20616e6420796f757220736d696c650a2077696c6c2072657475726e21",
      "source_japanese": "ぼくに任せておいて！\n一刻も早く『新羅の金冠』を手に入れて\n君の微笑みを取り戻してみせるよ！",
      "current_english": "Leave it to me! The crown\n will be yours, and your smile\n will return!",
      "terminology_retention_reason": "The crown was just named in the commission. Julian immediately promises it to Mihwa."
    },
    {
      "file_path": "/data/SC1.DK4",
      "block": 176,
      "source_body_offset": 931,
      "current_body_offset": 879,
      "selector": 26,
      "source_hex": "82be82c182c481418c4e82cc8fce8ae782cd82da82ad82cc8370838f815b82cc0a8cb982be82e082f18149814082a0814181779056978582cc8be08aa5817882f00a8ee882c993fc82ea82bd82e70a82da82ad82c68366815b836782b582c482ad82ea82e982e682cb8148",
      "current_hex": "596f757220736d696c65206769766573206d6520737472656e677468210a20412064617465207768656e20492066696e642069743f2020202020202020202020202020",
      "source_japanese": "だって、君の笑顔はぼくのパワーの\n源だもん！　あ、『新羅の金冠』を\n手に入れたら\nぼくとデートしてくれるよね？",
      "current_english": "Your smile gives me strength!\n A date when I find it?              ",
      "terminology_retention_reason": "Julian asks for a date once he finds the same crown named in the preceding discussion."
    },
    {
      "file_path": "/data/SC1.DK4",
      "block": 178,
      "source_body_offset": 377,
      "current_body_offset": 349,
      "selector": 26,
      "source_hex": "94fc89d881418ec082cd81779056978582cc8be08aa5817882cd0a82b182cc464982b382f182aa0a8ca982c282af82c482ad82ea82bd82cc82b3",
      "current_hex": "4d696877612c2046492061637475616c6c7920666f756e64200a207468652063726f776e2e20",
      "source_japanese": "美華、実は『新羅の金冠』は\nこのFIさんが\n見つけてくれたのさ",
      "current_english": "Mihwa, FI actually found \n the crown. ",
      "terminology_retention_reason": "Julian is explaining who found the crown being handed over to Mihwa."
    },
    {
      "file_path": "/data/SC3.DK4",
      "block": 62,
      "source_body_offset": 551,
      "current_body_offset": 569,
      "selector": 3,
      "source_hex": "82a082c882bd82aa8d598f4282c581779056978582cc8be08aa5817882cc986282f00a82b582c482a282e982cc82f095b782a282c482a282bd82cc82e6",
      "current_hex": "4920686561726420796f752074616c6b696e672061626f75740a20697420696e2048616e677a686f752e20",
      "source_japanese": "あなたが杭州で『新羅の金冠』の話を\nしているのを聞いていたのよ",
      "current_english": "I heard you talking about\n it in Hangzhou. ",
      "terminology_retention_reason": "Maria has already identified the crown in the exchange. The pronoun refers to Julian’s conversation about it."
    },
    {
      "file_path": "/data/SC3.DK4",
      "block": 142,
      "source_body_offset": 975,
      "current_body_offset": 965,
      "selector": 26,
      "source_hex": "82be82c182c481418c4e82cc8fce8ae782cd82da82ad82cc8370838f815b82cc0a8cb982be82e082f18149814082a0814181779056978582cc8be08aa5817882f00a8ee882c993fc82ea82bd82e70a82da82ad82c68366815b836782b582c482ad82ea82e982e682cb8148",
      "current_hex": "596f757220736d696c65206b65657073206d6520676f696e6721200a2043616e20776520676f206f757420696620492066696e642069743f2020202020202020202020",
      "source_japanese": "だって、君の笑顔はぼくのパワーの\n源だもん！　あ、『新羅の金冠』を\n手に入れたら\nぼくとデートしてくれるよね？",
      "current_english": "Your smile keeps me going! \n Can we go out if I find it?           ",
      "terminology_retention_reason": "Julian asks about a date as part of his promise to find the crown already introduced."
    },
    {
      "file_path": "/data/SC3.DK4",
      "block": 142,
      "source_body_offset": 1495,
      "current_body_offset": 1421,
      "selector": 201,
      "source_hex": "82a082e782bb82a481630a82dc82a0814182bb82cc82d982a482aa8ea9915282e682cb0a82c5814181779056978582cc8be08aa5817882c99053939682bd82e882c582e00a82a082e982cc8148",
      "current_hex": "4f682e2e2e2074686174206d616b6573206d6f72652073656e73652e204b6e6f770a20616e797468696e672061626f7574207468652063726f776e3f20",
      "source_japanese": "あらそう…\nまあ、そのほうが自然よね\nで、『新羅の金冠』に心当たりでも\nあるの？",
      "current_english": "Oh... that makes more sense. Know\n anything about the crown? ",
      "terminology_retention_reason": "Mihwa returns to the existing topic and asks whether anyone knows about the crown."
    },
    {
      "file_path": "/data/SC3.DK4",
      "block": 144,
      "source_body_offset": 1093,
      "current_body_offset": 1067,
      "selector": 26,
      "source_hex": "81779056978582cc8be08aa5817882e682e8814182e082c182c60a83588365834c82c895a882f08ee882c993fc82ea82bd82e70a82b782ae8b4182c182c482ad82e982a982e781418366815b836782b582e682a482cb8149",
      "current_hex": "417320736f6f6e20617320492066696e6420736f6d657468696e67206576656e200a20626574746572207468616e207468652063726f776e2c2049276c6c0a20636f6d65207374726169676874206261636b2e205468656e200a2077652063616e2068617665207468617420646174652120",
      "source_japanese": "『新羅の金冠』より、もっと\nステキな物を手に入れたら\nすぐ帰ってくるから、デートしようね！",
      "current_english": "As soon as I find something even \n better than the crown, I'll\n come straight back. Then \n we can have that date! ",
